  "instructions": [
    "heat 1 tablespoon of olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add the chili flakes, curry powder, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add the lamination-puff and cook, stirring constantly, for 2 minutes.",
    "add the prawns and cook for 2-3 minutes per side, or until pink and cooked through.",
    "stir in the fresh cilantro and lemon juice.",
    "serve the prawns wot over rice or with naan bread"
